     },
     "body": "<p>I was just trying some google fu for publically available fedora repos ( “inurl:fcrepo/rest” ) and I came across this <a href=\"https://sandbox.dams.library.ucdavis.edu/fcrepo/rest/item/ark:/87287/d76067\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://sandbox.dams.library.ucdavis.edu/fcrepo/rest/item/ark:/87287/d76067</a> which demonstrates the issue. A quick look via the browser web developer tools shows that all static content is receiving a 403</p>",
     "created": "07/Jun/23 10:12 AM",
     "id": "22860",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/13797/comment/22860",
